<title>UK: BOE gives UK money market 447 mln stg further help.</title>
<headline>BOE gives UK money market 447 mln stg further help.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said it provided the UK money market with a further 447 million stg of assistance at established interest rates.</p>
<p>It allotted 177 million stg outright in bills and 270 million stg in repos.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7708</p>
</text>
